    all the litter floating around down there.\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sen\xE1n\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-12.5,\"yPos\":230},\"ID\":20,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    wonder where it ends up?\",\"parentUIDs\":[19],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Sen\xE1n\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":290.5,\"yPos\":245},\"ID\":21,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Look
