    and I came over as soon as we could.\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Odhr\xE1n\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":25}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":295,\"yPos\":218},\"ID\":21,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You
    really haven't put our tools to much use.\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Odhr\xE1n\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":27}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":626,\"yPos\":66},\"ID\":22,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"We
    were happily able to get business with new customers.\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Odhr\xE1n\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":24}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-115,\"yPos\":213},\"ID\":23,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    hope this doesn't take long.\",\"parentUIDs\":[20],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Odhr\xE1n\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-132,\"yPos\":399},\"ID\":24,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    have customers to serve.\",\"parentUIDs\":[23],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Odhr\xE1n\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":293,\"yPos\":369},\"ID\":25,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"That's
